      "detail": "Stable Cargo has no cooldown. RFC 3923 was merged on 2026-05-18 and is implemented on nightly only. Until it lands, a Rust project's defenses are cargo-deny for policy, cargo-vet for review records, cargo-audit for advisories, and cargo install --locked so an install uses the lockfile it was tested with.",
